                <pb facs="0790" n="678" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg678"/>

                <head>[Inclosure No. 2.—Translation.]</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Official Gazette, June 30, 1910.]</seg></opener>
                <p>We hereby sanction and cause to be promulgated the regulations relating to the
                    organization of the police offices of the residency general.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sign Manual.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Privy Seal.</hi></item>
                        </list></signed><lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-06-29"
                                ><hi rendition="#small-caps">June</hi> 29,
                    1910</date></dateline></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>(Countersigned.) <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marquis Taro
                            Katsura</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Prime Minister</hi>.</p>
                    <p>(Countersigned.) <hi rendition="#small-caps">Viscount Masatake
                            Terauchi</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Minister of War</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
